  description: You cannot Xyz Summon monsters with the same name as a card you control.
    You can target 2 "Ryzeal" cards in your GY, except "Ryzeal Cross"; place them
    on the bottom of the Deck in any order, then draw 1 card. You can only use this
    effect of "Ryzeal Cross" once per turn. Once per turn, when a monster effect
    activated by your opponent resolves, you can detach 1 material from a "Ryzeal"
    Xyz Monster you control, and if you do, negate that effect.
